config DEMO_JOB_COUNT
	int "Number of ping-pong iterations sent by CPUAPP"
	default 100000
	range 1 1000000
	help
	  Total number of request/response exchanges measured by the benchmark.

config DEMO_PAYLOAD_SIZE
	int "Payload size in bytes per message"
	default 32
	range 1 256
	help
	  Fixed payload size embedded into each IPC message. Increase this value
	  to measure how exchange frequency changes with larger messages.

config DEMO_PROGRESS_INTERVAL
	int "Progress print interval in iterations"
	default 10000
	range 0 1000000
	help
	  Print a progress line after this many completed round trips. Set to 0
	  to disable intermediate progress logging.
